'''Gengar''' (Japanese: '''ゲンガー''' ''Gangar'') is a {{ct|Psychic}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Triumphant Light}} expansion.

