==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Arceus|Gengar|16}} from the {{TCG|Platinum: Arceus}} expansion.
*'''Hypnoblast''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Gym Challenge|Rocket's Mewtwo|14}} from the {{TCG|Gym Challenge}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

